ci-summary mutant unset-writes-nothing PKG-03

# PKG-04: the hosted run record and the gate's own CPU measurement line.
ci-log control ci-log-header PKG-04
ci-log control ci-log-fields PKG-04
ci-log control ci-log-duplicate PKG-04
ci-log control ci-log-order PKG-04
